# How to cite labinacan. GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository".
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the labinacan template or its package, please cite it as below.
title: "labinacan: the template of an agent-run research project"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Will
    family-names: Sackfield
repository-code: "https://github.com/8W9aG/labinacan"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  labinacan is the part of an agent-run research project that doesn't depend on what it
  studies: the site, papers, posts and literature review, the checks of code and prose,
  the release, and the skills that agents follow to work the project's issues.
